{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2020-04-21 09:30:00', 'title': 'Emerson Forecasts FY2020 Adjusted Earnings Per Share Between $3.00 And $3.20', 'text': 'EMERSON REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2020 RESULTS AND UPDATES FULL YEAR 2020 GUIDANCE.SEES FY 2020 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $3.00 TO $3.20.SEES FY 2020 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.62 TO $2.82.Q2 ADJUSTED GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.89 EXCLUDING ITEMS.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.74 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.UPDATING FULL-YEAR SALES AND EPS GUIDANCE DUE TO COVID-19 PANDEMIC AND MUCH WEAKER DEMAND ENVIRONMENT.QTRLY NET SALES OF $4.2 BILLION WERE DOWN 9 PERCENT.QTRLY GAAP EPS WAS $0.84.2020 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE GUIDANCE IS $2.62 TO $2.82.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.97 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.EXPECT 2020 CAPITAL EXPENDITURES TO BE $550 MILLION, COMPARED TO THE PREVIOUS GUIDANCE OF $650 MILLION.TOTAL RESTRUCTURING ACTIONS FOR YEAR ARE NOW EXPECTED TO BE APPROXIMATELY $280 MILLION.NO CHANGE IN DIVIDEND PLAN.EMERSON ELECTRIC - UPDATED 2020 GUIDANCE ASSUMES CONTINUED SIGNIFICANT DEMAND DETERIORATION IN Q3, & DEMAND REMAINING NEGATIVE THROUGH H1 2021.SHARE REPURCHASES, NOW COMPLETE FOR THE YEAR, WILL BE APPROXIMATELY $950 MILLION, COMPARED TO THE PREVIOUS GUIDANCE OF $1.5 BILLION.Q2 REVENUE VIEW $4.28 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}
